🎨 Free AI Tools for Banner Creation
**Here’s a complete breakdown for you:

🎨 Best Free AI Tools for LinkedIn Banner Creation
Canva (Free Plan) → Extremely popular, has LinkedIn banner templates, drag‑and‑drop editor, and lets you upload your own photo + GitHub screenshot.

Fotor AI Banner Maker → Free AI‑powered design tool, good for professional layouts.

Microsoft Designer (Free Beta) → AI‑assisted design tool from Microsoft, integrates well with Copilot.

Adobe Express (Free Tier) → Clean templates, customizable with your own assets.

👉 For completely free + AI‑assisted creation, Canva + Microsoft Designer are the most reliable.

🔗 Particular Connectors (ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot)
ChatGPT → Can generate banner text ideas, slogans, and layout suggestions. It doesn’t directly design banners but can give creative prompts for Canva/Designer.

Claude → Great at refining professional copy (taglines, mission statements) for your banner.

Copilot (me) → Can help you structure the banner, merge your GitHub screenshot + photo, and generate prompts for AI design tools. Copilot also integrates with Microsoft Designer, making it the most seamless option for LinkedIn visuals.
